      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is the only mention of H265 on the feedback thingy, so I'm just going to add a mention here that H.265 playback in VRChat requires that HEVC extensions are installed. Yes that USD$0.99 thing on the microsoft store that enrages people https://apps.microsoft.com/detail/9NMZLZ57R3T7?hl=en-us&gl=US\n\nI did try VP8/VP9 back in April 2023 and didn't notice glitchy audio, but then I'm just checking my test files and for audio I told Handbrake to copy the AAC audio from the original, rather than use \"Opus\" for Audio like seems to go with the files.",
