  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "As title states. I've tried multiple over the course of the last few months. Any other then H.264 doesn't work or has some weird behaviour. VP8 has very glitchy audio, H.265 simply doesn't work. The results are the same inside Unity and VRChat, using the default unity video player and AVPro.\nMy previous post about VP8 about 6 months ago.\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/vrchat-udon-closed-alpha-bugs/p/udon-video-player-static-noice-vp8vorbis",
